{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00108",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.18,
      "end_seconds": 4.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Hello there. Please, sit. Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.88,
      "end_seconds": 8.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "A couple of times, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.41,
      "end_seconds": 12.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.89,
      "end_seconds": 19.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "It's a weak urine stream. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.43,
      "end_seconds": 24.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Right, is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.28,
      "end_seconds": 32.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "It's been going on for four weeks. I'd been having to rush to the toilet, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.57,
      "end_seconds": 34.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.31,
      "end_seconds": 40.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.04,
      "end_seconds": 45.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Any weight loss, fever or blood in the urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.22,
      "end_seconds": 52.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, fever or blood in the urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.52,
      "end_seconds": 58.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "So, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.54,
      "end_seconds": 63.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.15,
      "end_seconds": 67.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "So, I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.59,
      "end_seconds": 70.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.53,
      "end_seconds": 80.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.12,
      "end_seconds": 84.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.23,
      "end_seconds": 87.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.14,
      "end_seconds": 90.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.9,
      "end_seconds": 96.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.13,
      "end_seconds": 110.37,
      "duration_seconds": 13.24,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Uh, I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.93,
      "end_seconds": 117.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.76,
      "end_seconds": 122.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils out, when I was a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.56,
      "end_seconds": 126.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.56,
      "end_seconds": 128.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.17,
      "end_seconds": 146.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.94,
      "end_seconds": 153.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "It's tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.19,
      "end_seconds": 154.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.4,
      "end_seconds": 159.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.1,
      "end_seconds": 163.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.67,
      "end_seconds": 165.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.08,
      "end_seconds": 173.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.72,
      "end_seconds": 178.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.85,
      "end_seconds": 190.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.11,
      "end_seconds": 196.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.81,
      "end_seconds": 200.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.28,
      "end_seconds": 218.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "On rectal examination the prostate feels smooth and enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.99,
      "end_seconds": 221.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.46,
      "end_seconds": 238.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Your bladder isn't palpable and the tummy is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.27,
      "end_seconds": 252.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "Right, all done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.14,
      "end_seconds": 256.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.38,
      "end_seconds": 258.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.75,
      "end_seconds": 289.86,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out a bladder problem yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.3,
      "end_seconds": 293.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.27,
      "end_seconds": 310.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.5,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a weak urine stream for four weeks, and no blood in the urine or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.28,
      "end_seconds": 315.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Exactly, you know, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.71,
      "end_seconds": 321.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Right, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.08,
      "end_seconds": 335.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.64,
      "end_seconds": 343.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "We should do a PSA test for urinary symptoms. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.14,
      "end_seconds": 348.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.74,
      "end_seconds": 372.17,
      "duration_seconds": 23.43,
      "text": "Cut back on tea and coffee after the afternoon and go before you sleep. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'd like you to see the urology clinic as well, and I'll write the referral. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.62,
      "end_seconds": 374.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.37,
      "end_seconds": 377.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.05,
      "end_seconds": 379.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.25,
      "end_seconds": 387.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.83,
      "end_seconds": 393.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.94,
      "end_seconds": 401.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.09,
      "end_seconds": 404.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}